            "title": "歐股高收近2% 德股飆513點 關稅憂慮紓緩",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">歐股收升，主要股市升約2%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"歐股 (AP圖片)\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/03/20250318_FI_source-ap_Britain_Financial_Markets-1.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"歐股 (AP圖片)\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/03/20250318_FI_source-ap_Britain_Financial_Markets-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">歐股 (AP圖片)</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美國計劃對歐盟加徵的關稅，可能未有之前憂慮般嚴厲，相關憂慮紓緩，帶動歐洲主要股市收市升近2%或以上。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">德國DAX指數收報25,215點，升513點，升幅2.08%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">法國CAC指數收報8,108點，升128點，升幅1.61%。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">英國富時100指數收報10,609點，升182點，升幅1.75%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美股周四感恩節假期休市，周五半日市。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17271694-%e6%ad%90%e8%82%a1%e9%ab%98%e6%94%b6%e8%bf%912-%e5%be%b7%e8%82%a1%e9%a3%86513%e9%bb%9e-%e9%97%9c%e7%a8%85%e6%86%82%e6%85%ae%e7%b4%93%e7%b7%a9",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/03/20250306_FI_source-web_eu-stock-2.png.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-27 08:41:17",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "油價向上   中東供應憂慮升溫",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">國際油價上升，布蘭特期油升逾2%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/06/OIL-PRICE_FB_source-ap_.png.webp\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/06/OIL-PRICE_FB_source-ap_.png.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">沙特阿拉伯最大煉油廠之前遇襲，加上有運油船在霍爾木茲海峽中水雷，加劇市場對中東原油供應的憂慮。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">倫敦布蘭特期油收市報每桶96.57美元，升1.96美元，升幅近2.1%。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">紐約期油因美國感恩節假期沒有結算，較早時報每桶84.91美元，升幅約1.5%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17271688-%e6%b2%b9%e5%83%b9%e5%90%91%e4%b8%8a-%e4%b8%ad%e6%9d%b1%e4%be%9b%e6%87%89%e6%86%82%e6%85%ae%e5%8d%87%e6%ba%ab",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/03/20200413-CH-oil_FB-1-1-1-1-3-1-1-1-2-3-1-1_source-ap_.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-27 08:41:17",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "美元假期前夕走勢靠穩 美匯指數微升報103.77",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">感恩節假期臨近，美元匯價表現平穩，美元指數較早時微升近0.04%，報103.77水平。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">主要貨幣方面，歐元兌美元表現窄幅整固，報1.097美元；英鎊兌美元下跌近0.1%，報1.3106美元；美元兌日圓則持穩於159.24日圓。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17271691-%e7%be%8e%e5%85%83%e5%81%87%e6%9c%9f%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%95%e8%b5%b0%e5%8b%a2%e9%9d%a0%e7%a9%a9-%e7%be%8e%e5%8c%af%e6%8c%87%e6%95%b8%e5%be%ae%e5%8d%87%e5%a0%b1103-77",
