            "title": "現貨金跌約0.4%報3,567.14美元 紐約期金升0.8%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">金價個別發展。現貨金下跌約0.4%，報每盎司3,567.14美元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">紐約2月期金則錄得上揚，報每盎司3,593.4美元，升幅為0.8%。</p>\n</div>",
